+Both confirmed the4 missing root imports and28 unrecorded standard pins remain exit1 coordinator checks, separately from passing worker/kernel guards and trust0 findings. Full validation remains pending coordinator merge under H41; delivery coordinator-pending. The earlier global registry misclassification is explicitly corrected rather than hiding the failed status.
